\end{enumerate}
\end{lemma}

\begin{proof}
Omitted. Hint: Follows from the case of schemes
(Divisors, Lemma \ref{divisors-lemma-strict-transform-flat})
by \'etale localization
(Lemma \ref{spaces-divisors-lemma-strict-transform-local}).
